      </tbody>
    </table></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="sec" id="open"><div class="wrap doc">
    <h2>12. Still open, as of launch</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The <strong>privacy policy</strong> on the live site is the old one and is now wrong about the host. A replacement is drafted and waits on church approval.</li>
      <li><strong>Done 7 Sep 2026:</strong> Cloudflare <em>Always Use HTTPS</em> is on, and a Redirect Rule named <code>www to apex</code> sends <code>www.brbcbaytown.org</code> to the bare domain. If either ever stops working, both live in the Cloudflare dashboard, not in this repository.</li>
      <li>The <strong>Google Business Profile is unclaimed</strong> and has no reviews. This matters more for "church in Baytown" searches than anything on the website. The review link is in Church Info. See SEO-AUDIT.md §2.</li>
      <li><strong>Yelp and Yellow Pages call the church "Baker Rd"</strong>, and several directories still list <code>bakerroadbc@comcast.net</code>. Claim and correct them.</li>
      <li>The <strong>YouTube API key is blank</strong>, so the sermon sync only sees the 15 newest videos. Add a key and the older sermons appear.</li>
      <li>Several <strong>claims on the site are unconfirmed</strong> — Bibles in the pews, the 10:15–11:40 running order, food trucks at the Pumpkin Patch. One conversation with Pastor Marvin clears them. Listed in OPEN-QUESTIONS.md.</li>
